@startuml uc1
title Use Case 1 - Departure
actor       Mariner          as v
participant "On-board systems" as vs
participant "TCS Service"    as vtss
actor       VTS             as vts

v --> v : Prepare departure from berth
v --> vs : Generate traffic clearance message
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Send message
note left
journeyId: urn:mrn:iala:journey:duckville:12345
vesselId: urn:mrn:imo:imo-number:0031300
gml:id: id-d67dcadb-41fe-4878-bdd7-8954ebd2f9b8
reportedAt: 2100-01-01T12:00:00Z
reportedBy: urn:mrn:mcp:entity:duckville:donald-duck
clearanceMessage:
    subject: Departure Berth
    effectiveTime: 2100-01-01T14:00:00Z
    windowAfter: 00:10
    messageStatus: Requested
    affefctedArea: 
        locationURN: urn:mrn:iala:location:duckville:berth:313
        locationType: From
end note 
activate vtss
vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
deactivate vs
vtss --> vts : Notify of message
deactivate vtss
vts --> vts : Decide if departure is ok
vts --> vts : Decide new suggested departure window if required
vts --> vtss : Reply to vessel
activate vtss
vtss --> vtss : use original gml:id as referenceMessageId
vtss --> vtss : generate gml:id
vtss --> vs : Send message
note right
journeyId: urn:mrn:iala:journey:duckville:12345
vesselId: urn:mrn:imo:imo-number:0031300
gml:id: id-83583780-75a9-403a-9e25-c39279dacc5d
referenceMessageId: id-d67dcadb-41fe-4878-bdd7-8954ebd2f9b8
reportedAt: 2100-01-01T12:05:00Z
reportedBy: urn:mrn:mcp:entity:duckville:donald-duck
clearanceMessage:
    subject: Departure Berth
    effectiveTime: 2100-01-01T15:00:00Z
    windowBefore: 00:10
    messageStatus: Requested
    affefctedArea: 
        locationURN: urn:mrn:iala:location:duckville:berth:313
        locationType: From
end note 
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge message
deactivate vtss
vs --> v : Notify of message
deactivate vs
v --> vs : Accept revised ETD
activate vs
vs --> vs : use proposal gml:id as referenceMessageId
vs --> vs : generate gml:id
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge accepted revised ETD
note left
journeyId: urn:mrn:iala:journey:duckville:12345
vesselId: urn:mrn:imo:imo-number:0031300
gml:id: id-c80bd6c2-39af-4f3e-bcde-7a2ab45ac37a
referenceMessageId: id-83583780-75a9-403a-9e25-c39279dacc5d
reportedAt: 2100-01-01T12:05:00Z
reportedBy: urn:mrn:mcp:entity:duckville:donald-duck
clearanceMessage:
    subject: Departure Berth
    effectiveTime: 2100-01-01T15:00:00Z
    windowBefore: 00:10
    messageStatus: Confirmed
    affefctedArea: 
        locationURN: urn:mrn:iala:location:duckville:berth:313
        locationType: From
end note 
activate vtss
vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
deactivate vs
vtss --> vts : Notify of acknowledgment 
deactivate vtss
@enduml

@startuml uc2a
title Use Case 2a - Passing through VTS area with direct confirmation
actor       Mariner          as v
participant "On-board systems" as vs
participant "TCS Service"    as vtss
actor       VTS             as vts

v --> v : Notice that route goes through a VTS area
v --> vs : Instruct system to send route plan to VTS
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Send schedule and request for traffic clearance
activate vtss
vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
deactivate vs
vtss --> vts : Notify of request
deactivate vtss
vts --> vts : Determine if route and schedule is suitable
vts --> vtss : Confirm plan
activate vtss
vtss --> vtss : use original gml:id as referenceMessageId
vtss --> vtss : generate gml:id
vtss --> vs : Send message
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge message
deactivate vtss
vs --> v : Notify of confirmation
deactivate vs
v --> v : Enter VTS area
@enduml

@startuml uc2b
title Use Case 2b - Passing through VTS area with changes
actor       Mariner          as v
participant "On-board systems" as vs
participant "TCS Service"    as vtss
actor       VTS             as vts

v --> v : Notice that route goes through a VTS area
v --> vs : Instruct system to send route plan to VTS
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Send schedule and request for traffic clearance
activate vtss
vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
deactivate vs
vtss --> vts : Notify of request
deactivate vtss
vts --> vts : Determine if route and schedule is suitable
vts --> vts : Generate change to plan
vts --> vtss : Send new RTA to vessel
activate vtss
vtss --> vtss : use original gml:id as referenceMessageId
vtss --> vtss : generate gml:id
vtss --> vs : Send message
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge message
deactivate vtss
vs --> v : Notify of change request
deactivate vs
v --> vs : Revise route
activate vs
vs --> vs : use proposal gml:id as referenceMessageId
vs --> vs : generate gml:id
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge approval of revised route 
activate vtss
vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
deactivate vs
vtss --> vts : Notify of approval
deactivate vtss
v --> v : Enter VTS area
@enduml

@startuml uc3
title Use Case 3 Arriving vessel with multiple rounds of message sending
actor       Mariner          as v
participant "On-board systems" as vs
participant "TCS Service"    as vtss
actor       VTS             as vts

v --> v : Before entering VTS area, determine it will be entered
v --> vs : Instruct system to send schedule to VTS
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Request traffic clearance to enter given area
activate vtss 
vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
deactivate vs
vtss --> vts : Notify of request
deactivate vtss
vts --> vts : Determine if schedule and planned route is suitable
vts --> vts : Prepare new schedule
vts --> vtss : Send new RTA to vessel
activate vtss
vtss --> vtss : use original gml:id as referenceMessageId
vtss --> vtss : generate gml:id
vtss --> vs : Send message
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge message
deactivate vtss
vs --> v : Notify of change request
deactivate vs
v --> v : Determine that proposale is not acceptable
v --> v : Revise route
v --> vs : Send revised schedule to VTS
activate vs
vs --> vs : use proposal gml:id as referenceMessageId
vs --> vs : generate gml:id
vs --> vtss : Send message
activate vtss
vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
deactivate vs
vtss --> vts : Notify of request
deactivate vtss
vts --> vts : Determine if schedule and planned route is suitable
vts --> vtss : Confirm schedule
activate vtss
vtss --> vtss : use original proposal as referenceMessageId
vtss --> vtss : generate gml:id
vtss --> vs : Send confirmation to vessel
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge message
vs --> vtss : Acknowledge message
deactivate vtss
vs --> v : Notify of confirmation
deactivate vs
v --> v : Enter VTS area
@enduml

@startuml uc4
title Use Case 4 Assigning anchorage position
actor       Mariner          as v
participant "On-board systems" as vs
participant "TCS Service"    as vtss
actor       VTS             as vts

v --> v : Mariner requires anchorage
v --> vs : Generate anchorage request message
activate vs
vs --> vtss : Send message
note left
journeyId: urn:mrn:iala:journey:duckville:12345
vesselId: urn:mrn:imo:imo-number:0031300
