@startuml uc6
title Use Case 6 - Change required to existing schedule
actor       Mariner          as v
participant "On-board systems" as vs
participant "TCS Service"    as vtss
actor       VTS             as vts

vts --> vts: An emergency occurs that requires all ships to reroute to different anchorage
alt Variant a 
    vts --> vtss: Send cancellation and rescheduling to ship
    activate vtss
    vtss --> vtss: Generate cancellation message to earlier confirmed anchoring operation
    vtss --> vtss: Generate new anchoring requirement message 
    note right
    journeyId: urn:mrn:iala:journey:duckville:12345
    vesselId: urn:mrn:imo:imo-number:0031300
    gml:id: id-7ea08583-d44a-4c21-b794-86446f4b5d54
    referenceMessageId: id-c80bd6c2-39af-4f3e-bcde-7a2ab45ac37a
    reportedAt: 2100-01-01T13:00:00Z
    reportedBy: urn:mrn:mcp:entity:duckville:donald-duck
    clearanceMessage: [ 
        subject: Arrival Anchoring Operation
        effectiveTime: 2100-01-01T15:00:00Z
        windowBefore: 00:10
        draftOrDraught: 3.13
        messageStatus: Denied
        affefctedArea: 
            locationURN: urn:mrn:iala:location:duckville:berth:313
            locationType: To
        ,
        subject: Arrival Anchoring Operation
        effectiveTime: 2100-01-01T15:00:00Z
        windowBefore: 00:10
        draftOrDraught: 3.13
        messageStatus: Required
        affectedArea:
            geometry:
                gml:Point: 1.0 1.0
            locationType: To
    ]
    end note 
    vtss --> vs : Send message
    activate vs
    vs --> vtss: Acknowledge message
    deactivate vtss
    vs --> v : Notify of cancellation and new requirement
    deactivate vs
    v --> vs : Approve change
    activate vs
    note left
    journeyId: urn:mrn:iala:journey:duckville:12345
    vesselId: urn:mrn:imo:imo-number:0031300
    gml:id: id-b62171fc-4b5d-4bb5-b12e-b8378e569f5f
    referenceMessageId: id-7ea08583-d44a-4c21-b794-86446f4b5d54
    reportedAt: 2100-01-01T13:01:00Z
    reportedBy: urn:mrn:mcp:entity:duckville:donald-duck
    clearanceMessage: 
        subject: Arrival Anchoring Operation
        effectiveTime: 2100-01-01T15:00:00Z
        windowBefore: 00:10
        messageStatus: Confirmed
        affectedArea:
            geometry:
                gml:Point: 1.0 1.0
            locationType: From
    end note 
    vs --> vtss : Send approval message
    activate vtss
    vtss --> vs : Acknowledge message
    deactivate vs
    vtss --> vts : Notify of approval
    deactivate vtss
else Variant b
    vts --> vtss: Send cancellation 
    activate vtss
    vtss --> vtss: Generate cancellation message to earlier confirmed anchoring operation
    note right
    journeyId: urn:mrn:iala:journey:duckville:12345
    vesselId: urn:mrn:imo:imo-number:0031300
    gml:id: id-7ea08583-d44a-4c21-b794-86446f4b5d54
    referenceMessageId: id-c80bd6c2-39af-4f3e-bcde-7a2ab45ac37a
    reportedAt: 2100-01-01T13:00:00Z
    reportedBy: urn:mrn:mcp:entity:duckville:donald-duck
    clearanceMessage: [ 
        subject: Arrival Anchoring Operation
        effectiveTime: 2100-01-01T15:00:00Z
        windowBefore: 00:10
        draftOrDraught: 3.13
        messageStatus: Denied
        comment: Await further instructions
        affefctedArea: 
            locationURN: urn:mrn:iala:location:duckville:berth:313
            locationType: To
    ]
    end note 
    vtss --> vs : Send message
    activate vs
    vs --> vtss: Acknowledge message
    deactivate vtss
    vs --> v : Notify of cancellation
    deactivate vs
    v --> vs : Confirm cancellation
    activate vs
    note left
